  "hazards": [
    "25:17\u201325 distinguishes Joash king of Israel son of Jehoahaz/Jehu from Joash father of Judah Amaziah.25:23 exact lineage in fixed witness retained without silent harmonization.",
    "25:18 Lebanon occurs inside Joash tree/thistle parable: no literal royal family marriage, actual animal event or chronology inferred.25:24 Obed-Edom name is not automatic identification with earlier bearer.",
    "26:5 Zechariah teacher distinct from24:20 son of Jehoiada unless source proof.26:11 Jeiel scribe/Maaseiah officer/Hananiah captain distinguished by role.26:17 Azariah priest distinct from named commanders or kings.",
    "26:19\u201323 leprosy narrative retained as ancient source account, no modern diagnosis/medical advice or link between disability and moral status generalized. Outcomes gated after first mention.",
    "27:1 Jerushah father Zadok not automatically earlier priest.28:7 Maaseiah king son not26:11 officer; Zichri mighty man of Ephraim requires role-specific identity.",
    "28:9 Oded prophet not silently merged with15:1 father of Azariah.28:12 Azariah son Johanan/Berechiah son Meshillemoth/Jehizkiah son Shallum/Amasa son Hadlai distinguished by fathers.28:15 return captives to Jericho then leaders return Samaria.",
    "28:19 king of Israel and28:20 Tilgath-pilneser source spelling preserved.28:23 help-from-Damascus-gods is Ahaz quoted reasoning, not narrator endorsing their efficacy."
